  PASS: no port is published to the host
  PASS: the script looks up its own internal address by alias
  PASS: and binds that address alone on the port gh expects api.github.com on
  PASS: when the alias does not resolve the script refuses rather than fall back to every interface
  PASS: so no branch of it ever asks for 0.0.0.0
  PASS: and that refusal ends the container, which acquire reports as unhealthy
  PASS: the upstream network defaults to the docker bridge
  PASS: which is the network with a route to the vendor APIs
  PASS: an operator may name another network with egress
